<title>SWITZERLAND: CYCLING-TOUR OF SWITZERLAND EIGHTH STAGE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF SWITZERLAND EIGHTH STAGE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>WETZIKON, Switzerland 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
